                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A big map with an empty Castle and a bunch of objects that have varying degrees of permeability comprise what is easily the most needlessly expensive survival/crafting game on the market.\nBuilding stuff is nonsensical. Objects variously allow you to walk through them or trap you inside.\nYour character model is wearing armor and carrying a sword but you can't use them to fight.\nThe dev says 12 months of early access with a steadily increasing price.\nI predict several weeks of updates followed by a complete abandonment of this awful game.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/EXAv2Wem8Do\n\n\n",
